22147      data Icecream;
22148      input count brand$ taste$;
22149      datalines;

NOTE: The data set WORK.ICECREAM has 15 observations and 3 variables.

22165      ;
22166      proc genmod data=Icecream rorder=data;
22167      freq count;
22168      class brand;
22169      model taste = brand / dist=multinomial
22170      link=cumlogit
22171      aggregate=brand
22172      type1;
22173      estimate 'LogOR12' brand 1 -1 / exp;
22174      estimate 'LogOR13' brand 1 0 -1 / exp;
22175      estimate 'LogOR23' brand 0 1 -1 / exp;
22176      run;

NOTE: PROC GENMOD is modeling the probabilities of levels of taste having LOWER Ordered Values in the response profile table.
NOTE: Algorithm converged.
NOTE: The scale parameter was held fixed.
